{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/21/2647372/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベストヒット歌謡祭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"星空になる〜のところ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員の指差す後ろ姿と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"星空のような一面ペンライトという、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴったりなカメラワークに感動した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うたコン、とても華やかだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三味線ブギウギ、可愛らしい曲で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お着物で踊れたのは貴重でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rの法則は久々のお絵描き楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも人物画苦手だ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私にとっての初回放送だった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!7の腹話術人形は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縄跳びで筋肉痛がしばらく続きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縄跳びって、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もはや人形遊びでもなんでもない(^｡^)、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blt graph. vol.13"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/21/2647372/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"箱根、芦ノ湖。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイナスイオン〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"霧が濃い中の撮影は幻想的でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマが、今の私にしっくり〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングインタビューも読んでね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/21/2647372/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/21/2647372/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末に向けてなのか、インタビューが多い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中の3本がさゆとだったの面白い〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部内容違うと思うからお楽しみに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/21/2647372/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、どんな道の上にいるのか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という質問は新鮮だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話しながら納得した感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}